    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>redroom</strong> is a fast-paced one-versus-one fighting game where a single hit means death. Maneuver around your opponent using dashes, slams, and wall jumps in order to hit them before they can hit you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/de249b8e24eb6a799839f88eac100ff7.poster.avif?t=1748628015\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/de249b8e24eb6a799839f88eac100ff7.webm?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/de249b8e24eb6a799839f88eac100ff7.mp4?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use snappy movement abilities to outmaneuver your opponent. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Duel on over 30 different procedural map arrangements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play a variable amount of rounds or until one person gets too far ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/5577a781478e8858a14fd3c417b8ef60.poster.avif?t=1748628015\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/5577a781478e8858a14fd3c417b8ef60.webm?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/5577a781478e8858a14fd3c417b8ef60.mp4?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join your friends or play with randoms through an integrated server finder. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the Menu Console to completely customize your experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recolor absolutely everything.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/c7303e1e885a09a64c95418830922ebc.poster.avif?t=1748628015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/c7303e1e885a09a64c95418830922ebc.webm?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Some users may find the menus difficult to use as they rely on a command-line format.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>redroom</strong> is a fast-paced one-versus-one fighting game where a single hit means death. Maneuver around your opponent using dashes, slams, and wall jumps in order to hit them before they can hit you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/de249b8e24eb6a799839f88eac100ff7.poster.avif?t=1748628015\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/de249b8e24eb6a799839f88eac100ff7.webm?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/de249b8e24eb6a799839f88eac100ff7.mp4?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use snappy movement abilities to outmaneuver your opponent. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Duel on over 30 different procedural map arrangements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play a variable amount of rounds or until one person gets too far ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/5577a781478e8858a14fd3c417b8ef60.poster.avif?t=1748628015\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/5577a781478e8858a14fd3c417b8ef60.webm?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/5577a781478e8858a14fd3c417b8ef60.mp4?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join your friends or play with randoms through an integrated server finder. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the Menu Console to completely customize your experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recolor absolutely everything.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/c7303e1e885a09a64c95418830922ebc.poster.avif?t=1748628015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894510/extras/c7303e1e885a09a64c95418830922ebc.webm?t=1748628015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Some users may find the menus difficult to use as they rely on a command-line format.</p>",
